## Tests

Tier definitions live in the `sdlc` skill, stage ordering in `ci-cd`. These are this repo's invocations — the pipeline runs exactly these.

| Tier | Command | Stage |
|---|---|---|
| unit | `{{TEST_UNIT}}` | DEV inner loop · CI gate |
| component | `{{TEST_COMPONENT}}` | DEV · CI gate |
| contract | `{{TEST_CONTRACT}}` | DEV · CI gate |
| smoke | `{{TEST_SMOKE}}` | DEV · STG, first and fast-fail |
| integration | `{{TEST_INTEGRATION}}` | DEV · STG, after the flip |
| e2e | `{{TEST_E2E}}` | DEV for debugging · STG prerelease |

**Every tier runs locally.** `-mock` is the default target; add `{{LIVE_FLAG}}` to resolve against STG. PROD is never a valid target and the run aborts if one resolves.

Nothing runs on save or edit. `pre-commit` is lint only; `pre-push` runs delta unit tests with a coverage check.

